  "Description": {
    "Cost": 877681,
    "UIName": "Ti Ts'ang",
    "Id": "chassisdef_ti_tsang_TSG-9DDC",
    "Name": "Ti Ts'ang",
    "Details": "Developed by MechWarriors from Warrior House Dai Da Chi, this variant of the Ti Ts'ang uses several experimental systems to provide a 'Mech customized to their needs. Using a Small Cockpit allows for a Supercharger to increase the ground speed of the 'Mech. The Hatchet of the standard Ti Ts'ang is replaced with a Lance that can penetrate armor in a single blow. Finally, the Small Lasers of the standard model have been replaced by Small X-Pulse Lasers. For greater accuracy, a Targeting Computer is used.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_titsang"
  },
